      {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "While often dismissed as cheap Star Wars clones, these 1980s space adventures helped launch many careers and pioneered early CGI techniques. **Metalstorm: The Destruction of Jared-Syn** (1983) was an early 3D sci-fi film, while **Spacehunter: Adventures in the Forbidden Zone** (1983) pushed the boundaries of practical effects. These films provided training grounds for effects artists and directors who would go on to bigger productions."
      }
